{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"We first examined the relationship between LFP spectral power and GI RPC scores in trials without FOG, in the DOPAOFF condition, in both patients with PD groups (Supplementary Fig S3).\",\n    \"We recorded LFP signals at rest, while standing, and during GI.\",\n    \"STN-LFPs data were first high-pass filtered at 1 Hz, notch filtered at 50 Hz, and epoched from 2 seconds before the cue to the end of the second swing phase.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"DOPAOFF, 12 patients with PD had FOG observed (FOG-OBS, 263 episodes), occurring at a mean of 8 steps after GI, and 26 had no FOG observed (NOBS; FOG-NOBS).\",\n    \"In the 12 FOG-OBS patients with PD, we recorded 99 trials where a FOG event occurred in the DOPAOFF condition (FOG-OBS+ trials), with a median onset of 8 steps (interquartile range [IQR] = 6–11.5) after GI, and a total of 263 FOG episodes (Fig 1E–G).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG-OBS+ trials) to those without (FOG-OBS− trials) in FOG-OBS patients with PD (DOPAOFF condition; Fig 6).\",\n    \"These changes were evident as early as the GI phase, prior to the observable FOG onset.\",\n    \"This study distinguishes 3 distinct FOG states in PD—absence, predisposition, and occurrence—each characterized by distinct GI strategies and STN activity patterns.\",\n    \"FOG-OBS patients with PD show early, identifiable changes in GI and STN activity patterns up to 19 seconds before FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有部分依据：论文确实首先分析了没有FOG发生的步态启动试次，而且STN-LFP记录集中在步态启动阶段，并未记录实际冻结发生期间的神经活动。但报告的整体证据分类不够完整。论文不仅研究一般FOG易感性，还明确分析了12名FOG-OBS患者中99个随后发生冻结的试次，将这些FOG-OBS-positive trials与没有冻结的试次进行比较，发现步态启动期已经出现与即将发生的FOG相关的STN-LFP变化。论文还专门设置了“Predictive Patterns of FOG Occurrence”和“STN Activity Preceding FOG Episodes”两个部分。因此，这项研究同时提供一般易感性和Pre-FOG事件关联证据，不能因为没有实际冻结期间的LFP记录，就将其整体主要归为一般FOG易感性证据。指控者的核心判断有全文依据。另需注意，摘要称冻结平均发生在步态启动后8步（mean），而Results正文报告的是中位数8步（median，IQR 6–11.5）；两者均支持约8步这一时间描述。综合而言，报告不是完全错误，但遗漏了会影响证据分类的重要Pre-FOG结果，因此判为partly，而非no。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e4778ae2-c6b0-46a7-84c0-6275d85de1db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104801103130Z", "elapsed_seconds": 131.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:50:12.284741+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "58a0a18e37fee80b995a2412c91f242154b8b1494a33a114c0a3a0bf301a083f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104801103130Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c729fa6fa4bd81a1fbcd2969f6e67e33003e4bcf6934207771d680741bea5e3d"}}}
